silhouette against tissue labels:
  z_seq  (sequence space)          -0.4355
  z_str  (structure space)         -0.0777
  z_epi  (epigenomic space)        -0.0660
  z      (fused gene x tissue)     -0.0176

z_seq should stay tissue-blind (it never receives tissue information);
if it scores as high as the tissue-aware towers, tissue information is
leaking into it. z_epi and z_str are both tissue-aware by construction
(chromatin state and contact topology are both tissue-specific), so a
similar silhouette between them is expected, not a red flag on its own.
